{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.poster.avif?t=1747096120\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.webm?t=1747096120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.mp4?t=1747096120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Haze</strong> is a retro-style 2.5D platformer in which Haze, a delivery robot, must defend his world against a horde of viruses that have begun to take over the digital world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haze is just a delivery robot, doing his job as usual at Alpha City, when suddenly...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge vortex opens up in the middle of cyberspace and strange creatures known as\u00a0<strong>VIROIDS\u00a0</strong>begin to spread through the cyber zones. To make matters worse, the defense unit system, aka <strong>D.U.S.T</strong> was completely corrupted! <strong>It's up to Haze to use his new combat abilities, given by an ancient being, to deal with this crisis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/edd6d4f73e242b6582ff1ed7edef939a.avif?t=1747096120\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of places with unique aesthetics, collect cybernetic power-ups to boost Haze's strength and agility, and battle the viral threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each cyber zone, filled with secrets, alternative paths, medals, and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each power-up temporarily changes how Haze looks and plays, with new moves and attacks to aid your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are extra challenges and minigames to unlock in the overworld</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectathon: Unlock the secrets of cyberspace by finding all the prism medals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the bytes you collect through the stages in the game shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and fluid controls that provide an enjoyable experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724420?t=1747096120","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724420?t=1747096120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/c708d234c7873379c28050f68881603e9c5df47d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747096120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/c708d234c7873379c28050f68881603e9c5df47d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747096120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.poster.avif?t=1747096120\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.webm?t=1747096120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.mp4?t=1747096120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Haze</strong> is a retro-style 2.5D platformer in which Haze, a delivery robot, must defend his world against a horde of viruses that have begun to take over the digital world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haze is just a delivery robot, doing his job as usual at Alpha City, when suddenly...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge vortex opens up in the middle of cyberspace and strange creatures known as\u00a0<strong>VIROIDS\u00a0</strong>begin to spread through the cyber zones. To make matters worse, the defense unit system, aka <strong>D.U.S.T</strong> was completely corrupted! <strong>It's up to Haze to use his new combat abilities, given by an ancient being, to deal with this crisis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/edd6d4f73e242b6582ff1ed7edef939a.avif?t=1747096120\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of places with unique aesthetics, collect cybernetic power-ups to boost Haze's strength and agility, and battle the viral threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each cyber zone, filled with secrets, alternative paths, medals, and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each power-up temporarily changes how Haze looks and plays, with new moves and attacks to aid your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are extra challenges and minigames to unlock in the overworld</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectathon: Unlock the secrets of cyberspace by finding all the prism medals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the bytes you collect through the stages in the game shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and fluid controls that provide an enjoyable experience.</p></li></ul>","developers":["LucasMegaStriker"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/5f06291a81fc316fe9dd0ab47e3126d1827b8696/header.jpg?t=1747096120","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3724420/1976024580/808923c06f149d0963d540ef631d793ae407f291/1750393622/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747096118","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3724420/1976024580/808923c06f149d0963d540ef631d793ae407f291/1750393622/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747096118","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3724420/1976024580/808923c06f149d0963d540ef631d793ae407f291/1750393622/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747096118","id":257137576,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137576/movie480.mp4?t=1747096118","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137576/movie_max.mp4?t=1747096118"},"name":"Cyber Haze - Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137576/c5781804e2f6b386e8a3aa80c821aed68ecbbc3a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747096118","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137576/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747096118","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137576/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747096118"}}],"name":"Cyber Haze","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></l